his will be clearly disclosed in the listing description.\nImportant terms:\nElectronics are sold\nAS-IS\nunless otherwise stated.\nOnly the testing explicitly described in the listing has been performed.\nIf no testing details are mentioned,\nno testing should be assumed\n.\nPower cords, adapters, batteries, manuals, or accessories are\nnot included unless specifically stated\n.\nUn-tested or partially tested electronics are\nnot eligible for refunds\n.",
